.CORRRECTION
    Configure the policy value for Computer Configuration >> Administrative Templates >> System >> Group Policy >> 
    "Configure registry policy processing" to "Enabled" and select the option "Process even if the Group Policy objects have not changed".
    Then rescan with Tenable ("Suad-VM-Test" DISA STIG scan (Win 11)") and confirm WN11-CC-000090 shows Passed.

